 * race_signal_test.c – Demonstrates an unsafe non‑reentrant call inside a SIGINT handler.
 * The program prints "Race detected" when the handler runs concurrently with
 * another thread that also calls printf().  It then shows the corrected version
 * using only async‑signal‑safe functions.
